{
  "bodyHash": "+5l9MCs81Cc=",
  "content": "<ul>\n<li><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/IDAS/BH_ID_HEADER.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;</li>\n</ul><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#800080\">&nbsp;支持 Forge 1.16.5、1.18.2、1.19.2、1.20.1</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#800080\">NeoForge 1.21.1</span></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>必需模组：</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Integrated API</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">机械动力 (Create)</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">夸克 (Quark)</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">补给品 (Supplementaries)</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>可选集成模组：</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Biomes O' Plenty</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Alex's Mobs</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Guard Villagers</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Artifacts</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Biomes You'll Go</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Regions Unexplored</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Terralith</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Waystones</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Farmer's Delight</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">冰与火 (Ice and Fire)</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Ars Nouveau</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Better Archeology</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">_________________________________________________________________________________________</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/g47qxf6.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#800080\"><strong><strong>什么是集成地牢与结构（IDAS）？</strong></strong></span></h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; <span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 集成地牢与结构（简称 IDAS）是一个模组，它使用夸克、Alex's Mobs 和机械动力中的方块与生物添加了大量细节丰富的结构，并可选集成许多其他模组。我厌倦了在整合包中安装结构模组后漫游世界，却只找到原版物品且毫无挑战性。我热爱精致的建筑和机械动力的机器，因此决定制作一个恰好填补我缺失内容的模组：充满传说、完整集成多个核心 Forge 模组的精美且富有挑战性的地牢与结构。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">如果你初次接触此模组，我强烈建议找到迷宫（Labyrinth）、工匠工坊（Tinker's Workshop）、远古矿井（Ancient Mines）或掠夺者堡垒（Pillager Fortress）并体验一番。这些结构花费了最多的建造时间，我认为它们真的非常有趣且回报丰厚。祝你好运！</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#800080\"><strong>看看我的其他项目！</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#800080\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/integrated-minecraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">Integrated Minecraft</a>，集成结构系列的官方整合包</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#800080\"><strong><a style=\"color:#800080\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/integrated-stronghold\" rel=\"nofollow\">Integrated Stronghold</a><br></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#800080\"><strong><a style=\"color:#800080\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/integrated-villages\" rel=\"nofollow\">Integrated Villages</a></strong></span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>配置与可选集成：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>对于 1.16 版本</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">编辑配置文件<br>IDAS 会自动检测是否安装了冰与火模组，并相应更改部分结构的战利品和生物</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br><strong>对于 1.18 及以上版本</strong><br>要启用 BOP 集成，请下载此<span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/idas-bop\" rel=\"nofollow\">数据包</a></span>。<br>要启用 Alex's Mobs 集成，请下载此<span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/idas-alexs-mobs\" rel=\"nofollow\">数据包</a></span>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">要配置其他内容，请下载此<span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/idas-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">数据包</a></span>。</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">要更改生成率，请修改结构集中的间距（spacing）和间隔（separation）。间距是两个相邻生成尝试之间的平均距离。取值范围 0 至 4096。<br>间隔是两个相邻尝试之间的最小距离（以区块为单位）。取值范围 0 至 4096，且不能大于间距。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">要编辑生物群系，请编辑标签/worldgen/biome/has structure 中的生物群系文件。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">要禁用结构，请移除其标签列表中的所有生物群系，或将间隔和间距设为极高的数值。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">要提高与其他结构模组的兼容性，请在每个 worldgen/configured_structure_feature 文件的“要避免的结构集”列表中添加结构。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>注意：</strong>使用全局数据包模组时，如果同时使用 BOP 和配置数据包，必须手动确保 BOP 集成数据包的优先级高于配置数据包。</span></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>已实现和计划中的功能：</strong></strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>超过 50 种独特的细节丰富的结构，分布于主世界和下界维度，包括：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 20 种独特的精致小型世界建筑结构，如营地、市场、动物巢穴等</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 7 个终局级别地牢，从广阔的矮人矿井到沙漠迷宫，再到掠夺者堡垒</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 机械动力主题的地牢，包含旋转死亡陷阱，如工匠工坊</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 15 个供疲惫旅人使用的独特房屋和小旅馆</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 6 座供探索的魔法巫师和附魔塔</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 沉没的海盗船</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 村民城堡</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 下界中的魔法塔和传送门供探索</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 基于事件的结构，如冬日马车和闹鬼庄园</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>计划中的功能：</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 地下地牢变种</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 更多下界和末地结构</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- <strong>加入我的 Discord 提出建议，并投票决定下一个添加的结构！</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#800080\"><strong>如果你在寻找某个结构时遇到困难，只需在聊天栏中输入 `/locate idas`，就会看到所有结构的列表。例如，输入 `/locate idas:castle` 将会找到离你最近的城堡。</strong></span></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>所有结构图片</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>宏伟迷宫，由CraisinLord设计</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/449/563/2022-04-01_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"429\" height=\"241\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/449/569/2022-04-01_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"427\" height=\"321\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>掠夺者堡垒，由CraisinLord设计</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/452/517/2022-04-12_20.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"378\" height=\"378\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/452/518/2022-04-12_20.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"374\" height=\"374\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>古老矿坑，由CraisinLord设计</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/458/716/2022-04-29_22.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"530\" height=\"298\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/458/717/2022-05-01_15.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"535\" height=\"301\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/458/718/2022-05-01_12.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"532\" height=\"299\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>巫师塔，由CraisinLord设计</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/449/570/2022-04-01_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"549\" height=\"412\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>附魔塔，由CraisinLord设计</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/458/734/2022-05-01_18.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"557\" height=\"313\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>废弃房屋，由CraisinLord设计</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/449/565/2022-04-01_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"548\" height=\"308\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/460/853/2022-05-10_20.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"549\" height=\"309\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>城堡，由CraisinLord设计</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/449/568/2022-04-01_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"553\" height=\"415\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/491/864/2022-08-26_14.png\" width=\"552\" height=\"310\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1049/87/2024-12-24_20.png\" width=\"550\" height=\"289\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>砖房，由CraisinLord设计</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/458/735/2022-05-01_18.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>乡村小屋，由CraisinLord设计</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/458/736/2022-05-01_18.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"551\" height=\"310\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>鬼屋，由CraisinLord设计</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/449/566/2022-04-01_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"546\" height=\"307\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/449/567/2022-04-01_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"551\" height=\"414\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>&nbsp;熊爪旅馆，由Howester1984设计</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/462/402/2022-05-19_17.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"567\" height=\"319\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/462/403/2022-05-19_16.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"568\" height=\"319\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>沉船，由CraisinLord设计</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/463/968/2022-05-22_08.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"569\" height=\"320\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>猎人小屋，由Howester1984设计</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/465/540/2022-05-29_10.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"571\" height=\"321\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>农舍，由Howester1984设计</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/466/920/2022-06-05_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"568\" height=\"319\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/466/922/2022-06-05_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"569\" height=\"320\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/475/722/2022-07-10_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"570\" height=\"321\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>女巫树桩，由Howester1984设计</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/469/155/2022-06-13_10.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"575\" height=\"323\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/469/156/2022-06-13_10.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"575\" height=\"323\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>隐士幽谷，由Howester1984设计</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/470/234/2022-06-18_15.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"584\" height=\"328\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/470/235/2022-06-18_15.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"583\" height=\"328\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>药剂师小屋，由Howester1984设计</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/475/720/apothecary.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"585\" height=\"329\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/475/721/2022-07-10_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"588\" height=\"331\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>渔夫小屋，由Nirze设计</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/477/943/2022-07-18_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"587\" height=\"330\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/477/944/2022-07-18_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"587\" height=\"330\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>赤角公会，由Howester1984设计</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/480/225/2022-07-23_08.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"584\" height=\"328\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>养蜂人小屋，由Howester1984设计</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/484/677/2022-08-09_09.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"583\" height=\"328\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>树顶酒馆，由Howester1984和chloe2cu设计</strong></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/485/811/2022-08-12_22.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"583\" height=\"328\"></strong></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>远古传送门，由CraisinLord和Nirze设计</strong></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/488/947/5959975b-dbad-419d-85d3-5287742817ab.png\" width=\"585\" height=\"329\"></strong></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/488/948/ed56c84f-9547-45a8-ada0-5bc5b05d95e1.png\" width=\"585\" height=\"329\"></strong></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>工匠作坊，由CraisinLord和Howester1984设计</strong></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/488/950/54124500-3512-4afe-b6f0-376fb5d72bd1.png\" width=\"582\" height=\"327\"></strong></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/488/951/07e24ea0-43c8-4fdd-a387-1be8f8b9361c.png\" width=\"582\" height=\"327\"></strong></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>死灵法师尖塔，由CraisinLord设计</strong></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/491/735/2022-08-29_13.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"583\" height=\"328\"></strong></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>集市，由Howester1984设计</strong></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/493/279/2022-09-05_11.png\" width=\"582\" height=\"327\"><br>鬼宅，由Howester1984设计<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/577/889/2022-10-20_15.png\" width=\"580\" height=\"326\"><br>冬日篷车，由Howester1984设计<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/577/890/2022-12-23_19.png\" width=\"580\" height=\"326\"><br></strong></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>不祥恐惧要塞，由CraisinLord设计（仅限冰与火模组）</strong></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/610/735/2023-01-21_10.png\" width=\"583\" height=\"312\"></strong></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong><br>枢纽，由Codex设计<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/641/934/2023-04-01_21.png\" width=\"585\" height=\"329\">该结构中的传送门包括：<br></strong></strong></span></p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p>以太</p>\n<p>暮色森林</p>\n<p>阿图姆</p>\n<p>下界</p>\n<p>厄瑞波斯/地下花园</p>\n<p>蜂巢之地</p>\n<p>伊甸之环</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>深海遗迹，由Howester1984设计</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/667/507/2023-05-26_11.png\" width=\"585\" height=\"329\"></strong></span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/667/508/2023-05-25_21.png\" width=\"585\" height=\"313\"></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>火车废墟，由brythonderoos设计<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/820/362/2024-03-07_00.png\" width=\"589\" height=\"315\"><br></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>冰封墓穴，由Darth Trayus设计</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/834/984/2024-03-12_11.png\" width=\"586\" height=\"313\"></strong></span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>挖掘现场，由Howester1984设计<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/905/364/2024-06-30_20.png\" width=\"589\" height=\"315\"><br></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>沙漠挖掘现场，由Howester1984设计<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/905/363/2024-07-01_16.png\" width=\"590\" height=\"315\"></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><br>工匠要塞，由Darth Trayus设计<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/905/361/2024-07-01_13.png\" width=\"592\" height=\"317\"><br></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>大法师塔，由Cpt_Gloval设计（需要安装Ars Nouveau模组）<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/905/362/2024-07-01_14.png\" width=\"588\" height=\"314\"><br></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>废弃灯塔，由Ghast设计<br></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1049/88/2024-12-24_20.png\" width=\"589\" height=\"310\"></strong></span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>收藏家博物馆，由Ghast设计</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1129/982/2025-03-17_19.png\" width=\"589\" height=\"315\"></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>风蚀神殿，由Jawredstoneguy设计</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1129/983/2025-03-15_23.png\" width=\"595\" height=\"318\"></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>塞壬海湾，由Howester1984设计</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1590/928/2026-03-20_14-55-57-png.png\" width=\"589\" height=\"315\"></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>植物学家小屋，由Howester1984设计</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1590/912/2026-03-20_14-46-06-png.png\" width=\"591\" height=\"316\"></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>原木小屋，由Howester1984设计</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1590/913/2026-03-20_14-48-39-png.png\" width=\"591\" height=\"316\"></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>废弃葡萄园，由Ghaast设计</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1590/925/2026-03-20_14-53-35-png.png\" width=\"593\" height=\"317\"></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>废弃教堂，由Ghaast设计</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1590/929/2026-03-20_14-50-22-png.png\" width=\"589\" height=\"315\"></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>废弃堡垒，由Ghaast设计</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1590/926/2026-03-20_14-54-33-png.png\" width=\"589\" height=\"315\"></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>废弃水井，由Ghaast设计</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1590/927/2026-03-20_14-55-17-png.png\" width=\"593\" height=\"317\"></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>石匠小屋，由Qwerty设计</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1590/930/2026-03-20_14-53-04-png.png\" width=\"596\" height=\"319\"></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>都铎风格酒吧，由Howester1984设计</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1590/900/2026-03-20_14-16-24-png.png\" width=\"589\" height=\"460\"></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>奇趣杂货铺，由Howester1984设计</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1590/908/2026-03-20_14-17-45-png.png\" width=\"546\" height=\"409\"></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>南瓜咖啡馆，由Howester1984设计</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1729/873/2026-06-11_10-53-24-png.png\" width=\"433\" height=\"353\"></strong></span></div>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>常见问题解答：</strong></strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">问：哪些生物群系模组兼容？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">答：大多数生物群系模组都兼容，包括 Terralith、BOP 和 BYG。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">问：为什么有这么多依赖项？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">答：是的。</span></p>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">问：你是否会向后移植或更新到 ___？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">答：我会随着依赖项更新，始终让模组保持与最新版 Minecraft 同步。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">问：这个模组能与其他结构模组一起使用吗？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">答：是的，所有 Yung 的模组、Repurposed Structures 等都能完美兼容，没有任何问题。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">问：我可以在整合包中使用这个模组吗？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">答：当然可以！我很乐意看到这个模组被用在整合包中。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">问：这个模组能只在服务端安装吗？<br>答：不能，因为它包含了自定义音乐唱片和原声带，并且修改了客户端结构方块。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">问：对于那些想住在结构里的玩家：如何阻止怪物生成？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">答：尝试使用 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/magnum-torch-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Magnum Torch 模组</a>。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">问：Quark 的哪些功能可以禁用？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">答：所有技术性改动和红石相关功能都可以禁用而不影响使用。但 IDAS 使用了 Quark 中的所有建筑方块。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong style=\"font-size:14px\">这里是一个由 KaupenJoe 制作的 </strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>非常</strong></span><strong style=\"font-size:14px\"> 精彩的 IDAS 模组视频展示：</strong></strong><strong style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/5DU4DlTWQiw?wmode=transparent\" width=\"428\" height=\"428\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fcraisincraft\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#800080\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/452/988/bh_id_promo.png\" width=\"1080\" height=\"160\"></span></span></a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#800080;font-size:14px\">我花了超过 300 个小时来建造和编写这个模组。我是为了这个模组专门学习 Java 的。如果你非常喜欢我的项目，两种极好的支持方式是通过 Patreon 直接赞助，或者通过 Bisect Hosting 购买服务器。点击上方图片获取服务器，使用我的代码 CraisinCraft 可享受首月 75 折优惠，和朋友们一起畅玩！设置过程非常简单，基本一键搞定。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#800080;font-size:14px\">点击下方图片进入我的 Patreon 页面直接支持我。你将获得专属的 Discord 身份组、聊天权限，并能直接影响 IDAS 的开发方向。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/craisinlord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#800080\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/453/148/digital-patreon-wordmark_fierycoral.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"432\" height=\"88\"></span></a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px;color:#800080\">特别感谢：</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px;color:#800080\">我的赞助者们！！！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px;color:#800080\">Howester1984、Nirze 以及 IDAS 建筑团队，感谢他们建造了本模组中许多美丽的建筑！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px;color:#800080\">Cama，感谢他制作了模组中那些美妙的音乐唱片。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px;color:#800080\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252fnighthearted%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nighthearted</a>，我借鉴了他城堡建筑中的原始外形，并用于掠夺者堡垒中。不过方块调色板、内部装饰以及所有细节都是我自己的创作。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px;color:#800080\">Bisect Hosting 团队，特别是 Perz，感谢他为本模组设计了标志！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px;color:#800080\">TelepathicGrunt（Repurposed Structures 的作者）。我大量使用了他们模组中的文件作为编码参考。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px;color:#800080\">YUNGNICKYOUNG，感谢他的结构模板管理器。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px;color:#800080\">我的猫 Fonzy，在我编写整个模组的过程中一直坐在我的腿上。腿上有点重量确实能帮助保持专注。</span></p><p>&nbsp;undefined</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">如果遇到任何问题或有任何建议，请点击下方图片或链接加入 Discord，我会尽力回复每一个人，并且非常欢迎建议！感谢你游玩并支持我的模组！</span>&nbsp;undefined</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252f72a7jmc5mb\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/IDAS/BH_ID_DISCORD.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"111\"></a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252f72a7jmc5mb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.com/invite/72a7jmc5mb</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
